#
# Fail-witness for ex:saConfidenceDeclaresNoFramework: it declares gmeow:confidence an instance
# of the epistemic framework, a classification its canonical owner logic:confidence does not
# make. Unioned with the provenance module by the gmeow:saFailWitness teeth check, it makes the
# ban's ASK hold, proving the ban catches a framework declaration rather than passing vacuously.
# The real module must never carry this triple.
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .

gmeow:confidence logic:instantiatesFramework logic:EpistemicFramework .
